The dataset is not covered by this licence and is not included in this repository.

The IEEE-CIS Fraud Detection data (train_transaction.csv and train_identity.csv) is provided by
Vesta Corporation under the rules of the Kaggle competition "ieee-fraud-detection". It is not
redistributable. The copy used to produce the committed artifacts was obtained by the author
through the author's own Kaggle account after accepting those competition rules; nothing in this
repository grants any right to the data. To reproduce the artifacts, obtain the files under your
own acceptance of the competition rules (scripts/download_data.sh, `make data`). No row of the
data is committed here; the artifacts under reports/ are aggregate measurements, and
reports/audit.json records the sha256 of the two files they were computed from.
